{# A status in words and colour (chapter 80): level is ok, warn or danger. Colour alone says nothing to
   a screen reader, or to someone who can't tell the colours apart, so the words are always there.
   Use: {% include 'components/_badge.html.twig' with {text: 'Available', level: 'ok'} only %}
   Chapter 87: text is English, translated here; a text with values comes translated already. #}
<span class="badge {{ level }}">{{ text|trans }}</span>
